# CATALOG-BOUNDS: the Gateway's catalog sends its head and half its body,
# then nothing for 45 s. fx's 30 s deadline is the whole request's
# (`gateway_json_fetch_timeout_ms`, src/gateway/client.zig:486-509), and
# reaching it is a failure it says it retries (`catalogRequestFailure`,
# src/builtins/gateway.zig:2510-2518), so `/model`, opened on the launch's
# first load, says so once 30 s are past. The snap waits for `Loading
# models…` to go, so a binary slow to launch is not caught still loading,
# and is taken at once: inside the 5 s backoff after the failure, before
# anything could ask again. A binary that never gives up fails the run.
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
models p5-input-models.json
modelsstall 45000
wait 4
type /model
key Enter
wait 2
snap loading
wait 20
until gone Loading models…
snap timed-out
gwlog
